    state machine
}

DreamPassSubsystem {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassSubsystem.h#DreamPassSubsystem
    src   "Which Custom Pass pipelines apply where, in one world.\n\nFour kinds of source activate a pipeline: the project settings' global pipelines, ADreamPassVolume,\nUDreamPassComponent and this subsystem's own API. For each view the subsystem gathers every activation, groups\nthem by pipeline -- a pipeline runs once per view however many sources ask for it -- and blends their parameter\noverrides in ascending priority, each by its weight, as post-process volumes do. Priority decides whose values\nwin; a pipeline's Order decides when it runs; the two are independent.\n\nIt also keeps what mesh passes select by: the pass layers primitives have (UDreamPassLayerComponent) and the\nnamed lists the API fills.\n\nGame thread only. The scene view extension it owns turns its answers into an immutable snapshot per view family;\nnothing here is read by the render thread."
    text  "某个世界中哪些 Custom Pass 管线在哪里生效。\n\n四类来源可以激活管线：项目设置里的全局管线、ADreamPassVolume、UDreamPassComponent，以及本子系统自己的 API。对每个视图，子系统收集所有激活、按管线分组——无论多少来源请求，同一管线在每个视图中只运行一次——并按优先级升序混合它们的参数覆盖，各自按权重参与，与后处理体积的做法相同。Priority 决定谁的值胜出；管线的 Order 决定它何时运行；两者相互独立。\n\n它还保存网格 Pass 的选择依据：图元拥有的 Pass 图层（UDreamPassLayerComponent）与 API 填充的具名列表。\n\n仅限游戏线程。它拥有的场景视图扩展会把答案转成每个视图族不可变的快照；渲染线程不读取这里的任何东西。"
    state machine
}

DreamPassSubsystem:AddPipeline {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassSubsystem.h#DreamPassSubsystem:AddPipeline
    src   "Runs Pipeline in this world's views -- every view, or PlayerIndex's only -- until RemovePipeline."
    text  "在此世界的视图里运行 Pipeline——所有视图，或仅 PlayerIndex 的视图——直到 RemovePipeline。"
    state machine
}

